# Layout ladder, step 9 (plan/20-core-domain/29-layout-ladder.md): a tank between two supplies and
# two returns -- the storage header sample verbatim. Two source boundaries charge a stratified tank
# at two levels and two consumer boundaries draw from it at two levels; nothing here is a loop.

fluidscript 1
circuit storageHeader
fluid dynamic water
show temperature

S1 supply t=60 flow=0.12
S2 supply t=45 flow=0.08
T1 tank volume=300 layers=5 t1=25 t2=30 t3=40 t4=50 t5=60 in1_level=90% in2_level=30% out1_level=90% out2_level=30%
RAD_NETWORK return flow=0.12
AHU_NETWORK return flow=0.08

connections
S1 - T1.in1
S2 - T1.in2
T1.out1 - RAD_NETWORK
T1.out2 - AHU_NETWORK
